    "description": "<p><img id=\"18911843\" src=\"https://forsyth.instructure.com/courses/276749/files/19710544/preview\" alt=\"image-483bf237-0207-4888-abae-88adf96828b8.png\" data-old-link=\"/courses/262/files/18911843/preview\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://forsyth.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/276749/files/19710544\" data-api-returntype=\"File\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: #273540;\">Now that you have watched the video on the importance of academic integrity in Forsyth County Schools, please read each scenario below and decide whether it is an example of academic <span style=\"color: #05396c;\"><strong>integrity</strong></span>&nbsp;or academic <span style=\"color: #05396c;\"><strong>dishonesty</strong></span>.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: #273540;\">You must answer all questions correctly and earn 100% for this module to be completed.</span></p>",
